OL,3,GNEWSACancer trial offers non-surgical
OL,4,Atreatment hope
OL,5,
OL,6,FA major trial has found that patients
OL,7,Fwith rectal cancer may be able to avoid
OL,8,Fmajor surgery and the need for a
OL,9,Fcolostomy bag.
OL,11,FLed by the Universities of Leeds and
OL,12,FBirmingham, the international trial
OL,13,Ftreated patients with early-stage
OL,14,Frectal cancer, with combinations of
OL,15,Fchemotherapy and radiotherapy instead
OL,16,Fof surgery.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
