OL,3,GNEWSACancer trial offers non-surgical
OL,4,Atreatment hope
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe findings, published in Lancet
OL,7,FOncology and funded by Cancer Research
OL,8,FUK, said the initial results suggested
OL,9,Fthat organb@Qpreserving treatment may
OL,10,Fbe a realistic option for many people
OL,11,Fwith early rectal cancer.
OL,13,FCancer Research UK said the findings
OL,14,Fcould be "life-changing for thousands
OL,15,Fof people".
